<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/16th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Treaty · Peace</p><h1 class="enc-title">Second Peace of Kappel</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1531</span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a> · Also known as Second Kappel Peace · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wars-of-kappel">Wars of Kappel</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Second Peace of Kappel, concluded in November 1531 after Zürich's defeat at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-kappel">Battle of Kappel</a>, ended the second religious war of the Old Swiss Confederacy. It left each canton free to choose its religion but protected Catholic worship in the common lordships, halting the spread of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/protestant-reformation">Reformation</a> and establishing a lasting confessional balance in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/switzerland">Switzerland</a>.</p></div>
